        <mxCell id="n9" value="&lt;b&gt;MULTIPLICITY EVIDENCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 at Student end&lt;/b&gt; — WR04: each registration belongs to exactly one student.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;0..* at Registration end (Student–Registration)&lt;/b&gt; — WR03: a student may have zero or many workshop registrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 at Workshop end&lt;/b&gt; — WR05: each registration is for exactly one workshop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;0..* at Registration end (Registration–Workshop)&lt;/b&gt; — WR06: a workshop may have zero or many registrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Attributes: &lt;/b&gt;studentId and name (WR01); workshopCode and title (WR02); registrationDate and status (WR07). {id} marks the unique identifier required by WR01 and WR02." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
